  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-18T10:20:57.701074Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T10:40:42.546598Z",
  "totalBlocks": 76,
  "translatedBlocks": 76,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af3df91506a3e0fc",
      "translationZh": "随着越来越多的代码生成模型向公众开放，如今我们已经能够以前所未有的方式，从文本生成网页，甚至从文本生成应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75ea6418f0062727",
      "translationZh": "本教程介绍了一种直接的 AI 网页内容生成方法，通过流式传输并同步渲染内容，一气呵成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edf55e33cb00f230",
      "translationZh": "在这里试用在线演示！→ Webapp Factory",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9ce4c73114d91869",
      "translationZh": "在 Node 应用中使用 LLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f956e3b5c7a383d",
      "translationZh": "虽然一提到与 AI 和 ML 相关的事物，我们通常都会想到 Python，但 Web 开发社区高度依赖 JavaScript 和 Node。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef6d534f605e09fc",
      "translationZh": "以下是你可以在这个平台上使用大语言模型的一些方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ef6481d4ad0e351b",
      "translationZh": "通过在本地运行模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d89d47172a274cd2",
      "translationZh": "在 Javascript 中运行 LLM 有多种方法，包括使用 ONNX、将代码转换为 WASM，以及调用用其他语言编写的外部进程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1505a9fddf6671e4",
      "translationZh": "其中一些技术现在已作为开箱即用的 NPM 库提供：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1c5708dd0a389c2c",
      "translationZh": "使用 transformers.js 等 AI/ML 库（支持代码生成）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "866d036fe00454f0",
      "translationZh": "使用 llama-node 等专门的 LLM 库（或用于浏览器的 web-llm）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ab9e22bafebd6e2",
      "translationZh": "通过 Pythonia 这样的桥接工具使用 Python 库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fc10afa639a2b9f",
      "translationZh": "不过，在这样的环境中运行大语言模型可能会消耗相当多的资源，尤其是在无法使用硬件加速的情况下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4ca974ea6aa1ac70",
      "translationZh": "通过 API",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed86883679f9f6b5",
      "translationZh": "如今，多家云服务提供商提供了用于调用语言模型的商业 API。以下是 Hugging Face 目前提供的服务：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c6b3b0a52c59e8e",
      "translationZh": "免费的 Inference API，让任何人都能使用社区中的中小型模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88b7728c88e58b58",
      "translationZh": "更先进、可用于生产环境的 Inference Endpoints API，适合需要更大模型或自定义推理代码的用户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de7c65bb5374062a",
      "translationZh": "这两个 API 都可以通过 NPM 上的 Hugging Face Inference API 库在 Node 中使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdb59819aedd4d78",
      "translationZh": "💡 表现最出色的模型通常需要大量内存（32 Gb、64 Gb 或更多）和硬件加速，才能获得良好的延迟表现（参见基准测试）。但我们也看到了这样一种趋势：模型体积不断缩小，同时在某些任务上仍能保持相对不错的效果，内存需求最低可降至 16 Gb，甚至 8 Gb。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cd74053c54816e47",
      "translationZh": "架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b974d9008e807b36",
      "translationZh": "我们将使用 NodeJS 创建生成式 AI Web 服务器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec0d859fafe55a8d",
      "translationZh": "模型将采用运行在 Inference Endpoints API 上的 WizardCoder-15B，不过你也可以尝试其他模型和技术栈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d25c44e7653b82e",
      "translationZh": "如果你对其他解决方案感兴趣，这里提供了一些替代实现的参考入口：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ee5666ec92de2159",
      "translationZh": "使用 Inference API：代码和 space",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7230c342c2b8e385",
      "translationZh": "在 Node 中使用 Python 模块：代码和 Space",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3952464a428f9963",
      "translationZh": "使用 llama-node（llama cpp）：代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d552c9333f3ff694",
      "translationZh": "初始化项目",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3100039bf78bc07d",
      "translationZh": "首先，我们需要创建一个新的 Node 项目（如果愿意，你可以克隆这个模板）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "baaae576321aeec6",
      "translationZh": "然后，我们可以安装 Hugging Face Inference 客户端：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ae08b4bcb144609",
      "translationZh": "并在 src/index.mts 中进行设置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "69aec1534b0755ed",
      "translationZh": "配置推理端点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4767d982b920deb9",
      "translationZh": "💡 注意：如果你不想为了完成本教程而付费使用 Endpoint 实例，可以跳过这一步，转而查看这个免费的 Inference API 示例。请注意，这种方式仅适用于较小的模型，它们的能力可能没有那么强。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a959703ed4ae7f13",
      "translationZh": "要部署一个新的端点，你可以前往端点创建页面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c43f9897d726a95b",
      "translationZh": "你需要在模型仓库下拉菜单中选择 WizardCoder，并确保所选 GPU 实例的规格足够大：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e13cb5d95adceaf",
      "translationZh": "端点创建完成后，你可以从此页面复制 URL：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ced3af955d590a1",
      "translationZh": "配置客户端以使用它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a0da2818823f29c",
      "translationZh": "现在，你可以让推理客户端使用我们的私有端点，并调用我们的模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5f6bafee68e9fe80",
      "translationZh": "生成 HTML 流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "076bce3ab8f11dd2",
      "translationZh": "现在，当 Web 客户端访问某个 URL（例如 /app）时，该向它返回一些 HTML 了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4239c6a31133912a",
      "translationZh": "我们将使用 Express.js 创建一个端点，以流式方式传输来自 Hugging Face Inference API 的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9064447f823ad35",
      "translationZh": "由于目前还没有任何 UI，我们将通过一个简单的 URL 参数来传入提示词，作为交互接口：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52c70ee0e649f559",
      "translationZh": "启动你的 Web 服务器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35e5cc58cf7a6f68",
      "translationZh": "然后打开 https://localhost:3000?prompt=some%20prompt。稍等片刻，你应该就能看到一些简陋的 HTML 内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "65d13700b1a469b3",
      "translationZh": "调整提示词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a51bed6f106af639",
      "translationZh": "每种语言模型对提示词的反应都不同。对于 WizardCoder，简单的指令往往效果最好：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fe6dfdba7a7dea3f",
      "translationZh": "使用 Tailwind",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3dbeec6fa900ba0",
      "translationZh": "Tailwind 是一个流行的 CSS 框架，用于设置内容的样式，而 WizardCoder 开箱即用就能很好地使用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "206faf72a08632b3",
      "translationZh": "这样一来，代码生成过程中就能随时创建样式，无须在页面开头或末尾生成样式表（那样会让页面看起来像是卡住了）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da7d8dd56a69371d",
      "translationZh": "为了改善结果，我们还可以通过示例来引导模型（<body class=\"p-4 md:p-8\">）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0243a70c73ea993d",
      "translationZh": "防止幻觉",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2382a05639f3d608",
      "translationZh": "与较大的通用模型相比，对于专门用于代码生成的轻量级模型，可能很难可靠地防止幻觉和失败情况（例如原样复述整段指令，或写出“lorem ipsum”占位文本），但我们可以尝试缓解这些问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7952de250bb0e2a",
      "translationZh": "你可以尝试使用命令式语气，并重复指令。另一种有效的方法是提供一部分英文输出作为示例，引导模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f8388029798308ed",
      "translationZh": "添加图像支持",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e50bd9d0682b700",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们已经有了一个可以生成 HTML、CSS 和 JS 代码的系统，但当被要求生成图像时，它很容易凭空编造出无法访问的 URL。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b66a1bb2e1519334",
      "translationZh": "幸运的是，在图像生成模型方面，我们有很多选择！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fccbb78b699b30f",
      "translationZh": "→ 最快的入门方式是使用我们免费的 Inference API，调用 hub 上提供的某个公开 Stable Diffusion 模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1a04082f325a7d5",
      "translationZh": "只需在提示词中添加下面这一行，就足以让 WizardCoder 使用我们新建的 /image 端点！（对于其他模型，你可能需要稍作调整）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c39ff343866aa209",
      "translationZh": "你也可以尝试写得更具体一些，例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a4788e9ed4bd97b6",
      "translationZh": "添加一些 UI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21716e50d1ef2579",
      "translationZh": "Alpine.js 是一个极简框架，让我们无需进行任何配置、构建流水线、JSX 处理等，就能创建交互式 UI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5e4447cf46f1556",
      "translationZh": "一切都在页面内完成，因此它非常适合用来为快速演示创建 UI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0778b0b90dec7fd6",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个静态 HTML 页面，你可以将其放在 /public/index.html：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3a8df9a6cb73370",
      "translationZh": "要让它正常运行，你需要做一些修改：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "56d93fb782d1cc53",
      "translationZh": "优化输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a0ed269ccfcb535",
      "translationZh": "到目前为止，我们一直在生成完整的 Tailwind 工具类序列，这非常有利于赋予语言模型设计上的自由。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8e77ca0d836c4b1",
      "translationZh": "但这种方法也非常冗长，会消耗我们很大一部分的 token 配额。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "654b229afdf52c7d",
      "translationZh": "为了让输出更加紧凑，我们可以使用 Daisy UI，这是一个将 Tailwind 工具类组织成设计系统的 Tailwind 插件。其思路是为组件使用简写类名，其余部分则使用工具类。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45200cd465425bbc",
